## HOLDS
No path outside P; no removed line; no product byte, helper, setting or dependency; no `.github/**`; no amend, rebase, merge of main, force or second push; no PR, Jira, deploy, merge to main, `az`, docker, ssh or hosted call; no write outside `.tools/b1339`, your clone, your STATUS and (by Step 8's rule only) the end of B1320_STATUS; no listener; no HP-tool integration. The branch lands only after a round 2 verdict and the landing is Tuesday's. **Not decided here, so not built:** the gate's other Notes (the `-uat-` and `demo` name shape, the whitespace-only site name, the banner row, the `signin-budget` timing row, the template's `demo` branches); any change under `infra/`.

